A deploy

Write the story `deploy`: the `Engineer` merges in `GitHub`, `GitHub` starts
`CI`, `CI` pushes to the `Registry`, and `Argo` pulls from the `Registry`.
Show it as a sequence.
---
story deploy {
  Engineer -> GitHub: merge
  GitHub -> CI: start
  CI -> Registry: push
  Argo -> Registry: pull
}
show sequence of deploy
